00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.200
Closing in with every breath, bringing the dark to light!

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.500
I've missed the chance to be merciful, that era is long dead!

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.800
Now I am the living nightmare that is living in your head!

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
I've seen this place on Instagram forever ago, a picture-perfect scene

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.200
But from where I am standing now, everything is digital and mean

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.500
Your data was processed on June 21, precision that cannot be denied

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.800
There are no safe houses left for you, nowhere you can hide

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.000
Your security deposit of trust is gone, forfeited to my control

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.200
